.TH ORANGE-CLI 1 2026-10-18 orange "User Commands"
.SH NAME
orange-cli \- use XMPP from the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B orange-cli
.RI [ option ]...
.RI [ command
.RI [ argument ]...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B orange-cli
talks to
.BR orange-agent (1),
which holds the XMPP sessions.
Without a command, it starts an interactive session.
None of the commands is implemented yet.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B send
Send a message.
.TP
.B roster
Show the contact list.
.TP
.B log
Show message history.
.TP
.B listen
Print incoming events as they arrive.
.TP
.B repl
Start an interactive session (the default).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display a usage message and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Output version information and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 for
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-\-version ,
1 otherwise, 2 for an unknown command or option.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR orange-agent (1),
.BR oranged (8)
.PP
